                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1161400                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  MATCHAR W91042-FIL OCH BUY-BACK FIL (W11604)          *        
*                OCH SKAPAR ARTIKELFIL MED BUY BACK KOD.                        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  BODIL LINDAHL                                         *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  AUGUSTI 1997                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  BUY-BACKFIL                         *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11614D1                                                                   
%W11604   'BB-'                                                                 
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  W91042 EXTRAKT FRÅN WDK6 OCH WDK7   *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11614D2                                                                   
%W91042   'LB-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  UTFIL                               *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11614D3 FB (393 0)                                                        
%W11614    'UT-'                                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  TEMPFIL                             *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE TPFIL1 FB (393 0) VIRTUAL                                                  
%W11614    'TEMP1-'                                                             
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  CROSSFIL                            *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11614D5                                                                   
%W11685    'CROSS-'                                                             
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  PARAMETRAR TILL WDATKONV            *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
%WDATAREA                                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  ARBETSFÄLT                          *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
 W-ORDERING               W  5 P 0 OCCURS 8                                     
 W-SUORDERTRAFF           W  5 P 0 VALUE 0                                      
 W-SUORDERING             W  5 P 0 VALUE 0                                      
 W-DISP-TOT               W  4 P   VALUE 0                                      
 W-KVLS-TOT               W  4 P   VALUE 0                                      
 W-KVAKS-TOT              W  4 P   VALUE 0                                      
 W-KVOKS-TOT              W  5 P   VALUE 0                                      
 W-KDBBCL                 W  1 N                                                
 JA                       W  1 A   VALUE 'J'                                    
 NEJ                      W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 IX1                      W  2 N   VALUE 0                                      
 IX2                      W  1 N   VALUE 0                                      
                                                                                
 DAGENS-DATUM             W  5 N                                                
 DD-YY     DAGENS-DATUM      2 N                                                
 DD-WW     DAGENS-DATUM +2   2 N                                                
 DD-DAY    DAGENS-DATUM +4   1 N                                                
                                                                                
 DATUM1                   W  8 A                                                
 AA1     DATUM1              2 A                                                
 MM1     DATUM1 +3           2 A                                                
 DD1     DATUM1 +6           2 A                                                
                                                                                
 DATUM2                   W  6 A                                                
 AA2     DATUM2              2 A                                                
 MM2     DATUM2 +2           2 A                                                
 DD2     DATUM2 +4           2 A                                                
 DATUM   DATUM2              6 N                                                
                                                                                
 HELP-DATE                W  5 N                                                
 HELP-YY   HELP-DATE         2 N                                                
 HELP-WW   HELP-DATE +2      2 N                                                
 HELP-DAY  HELP-DATE +4      1 N                                                
                                                                                
 WS-TIFINLV               W  5 N                                                
 WS-YY     WS-TIFINLV        2 N                                                
 WS-WW     WS-TIFINLV  +2    2 N                                                
 WS-DAY    WS-TIFINLV  +4    1 N                                                
                                                                                
 KOLL-TIFINLV             W  5 N                                                
 KOLL-YY   KOLL-TIFINLV      2 N                                                
 KOLL-WW   WS-TIFINLV  +2    2 N                                                
 KOLL-DAY  WS-TIFINLV  +4    1 N                                                
                                                                                
 W-TIERSDAT                    W  7 N                                           
 W-TIERSDAT-SEKEL  W-TIERSDAT     2 N                                           
 W-TIERSDAT-AAVVDD W-TIERSDAT +2  5 N                                           
                                                                                
 DATUM-10AR                   W  7 N                                            
 SEKEL-10        DATUM-10AR      2 N                                            
 DATUM-10-AAVVD  DATUM-10AR +2   5 N                                            
                                                                                
 FKNGRP-BUYBACK           W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 PRODSLAG-BUYBACK1        W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 PRODSLAG-BUYBACK2        W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 PRODSLAG-BUYBACK3        W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 WDATKONV                 W  8 A   VALUE 'WDATKONV'                             
 W-IDFKNGRP               W  4 N                                                
 W-IDFKNGRP-SERIE W-IDFKNGRP 2 N                                                
 WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV   W  2 P                                                
                                                                                
%WY2000W2                                                                       
%WWPRODSL  'LB-' WORK ''                                                        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*------------------------------------------------------------------*            
* STEG 1. MATCHAR W91042 & BUY-BACK FIL TILL TEMPFIL1              *            
* -----------------------------------------------------------------*            
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W11614D1 KEY(BB-IDARTNR) W11614D2 KEY(LB-IDARTNR))     +             
                                    START  A-INIT                               
                                                                                
    IF MATCHED                                                                  
      IF LB-FLLSRDEL = JA AND LB-PRARTSTD > 0 AND LB-PRARTSJK > 0               
        W-KDBBCL = BB-KDBBCL                                                    
        PERFORM S01-SOLLA-SKRIV-POST                                            
      END-IF                                                                    
    ELSE                                                                        
      IF W11614D2                                                               
        IF LB-FLLSRDEL = JA AND LB-PRARTSTD > 0 AND LB-PRARTSJK > 0             
          W-KDBBCL = 0                                                          
          PERFORM S01-SOLLA-SKRIV-POST                                          
        END-IF                                                                  
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
 A-INIT.  PROC                                                                  
                                                                                
 DATUM1 = SYSDATE                                                               
 AA2 = AA1                                                                      
 MM2 = MM1                                                                      
 DD2 = DD1                                                                      
 DAT-I-TIDATUM = DATUM                                                          
 DAT-KDDATFORM = 'AAMMDD'                                                       
 CALL WDATKONV USING (DAT-KDDATFORM, DAT-I-TIDATUM, DAT-O-TIDATUM,  +           
                      DAT-KDSVAR)                                               
                                                                                
*** HELP-DATE ANVÄNDS VID UTRÄKNING AV RETUR-STATUSKOD                          
 HELP-DATE = DAT-TIAAVVD                                                        
 HELP-DAY  = 1                                                                  
                                                                                
 SEKEL-10  EQ 20                                                                
                                                                                
 DATUM-10-AAVVD  = DAT-TIAAVVD                                                  
 DISPLAY ' DATUM-10AR  INNAN OMRÄKNING ' DATUM-10AR                             
 DATUM-10AR      = DATUM-10AR   - 10000                                         
                                                                                
 DISPLAY ' DATUM-10AR ' DATUM-10AR                                              
 DISPLAY ' HELPDATE   ' HELP-DATE                                               
                                                                                
 END-PROC                                                                       
NEWPAGE                                                                         
 S01-SOLLA-SKRIV-POST.  PROC                                                    
                                                                                
 WS-TIFINLV = LB-TIFINLV                                                        
                                                                                
 TMP1-YYWWD = HELP-DATE                                                         
 TMP2-YYWWD = WS-TIFINLV                                                        
 PERFORM WY2000P2                                                               
 DAGENS-DATUM = TMP1-YYWWD                                                      
 KOLL-TIFINLV = TMP2-YYWWD                                                      
                                                                                
 IF KOLL-YY > DD-YY                                                             
    WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV = WS-WW + 53 - HELP-WW                               
 ELSE                                                                           
   IF HELP-YY = WS-YY                                                           
     IF WS-WW > HELP-WW                                                         
        WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV = WS-WW - HELP-WW                                
     ELSE                                                                       
        WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV = 0                                              
     END-IF                                                                     
   ELSE                                                                         
     WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV = 0                                                 
   END-IF                                                                       
 END-IF                                                                         
                                                                                
 IF LB-TIERSDAT > 0                                                             
   IF LB-TIERSDAT > 50000                                                       
     W-TIERSDAT-SEKEL EQ 19                                                     
   ELSE                                                                         
     W-TIERSDAT-SEKEL EQ 20                                                     
   END-IF                                                                       
   W-TIERSDAT-AAVVDD = LB-TIERSDAT                                              
 ELSE                                                                           
   W-TIERSDAT = 99999999                                                        
 END-IF                                                                         
                                                                                
 PERFORM S25-CHECK-LB-KDPRODSL                                                  
                                                                                
 IF WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV > 30          +                                      
 OR W-TIERSDAT          < DATUM-10AR     +                                      
 OR LB-KDERS-UTG        > 0              +                                      
 OR LB-KDERS            = 52             +                                      
 OR LB-IDFKNGRP         = 0              +                                      
 OR LB-KDPRODSL         = 0              +                                      
 OR LB-KDPRODSL         = KDPRODSL-LOCAL +                                      
 OR LB-KDPRODSL         = KDPRODSL-LYNK                                         
    CONTINUE                                                                    
 ELSE                                                                           
    PERFORM S02-SKRIV-POST                                                      
 END-IF                                                                         
                                                                                
 END-PROC                                                                       
NEWPAGE                                                                         
 S02-SKRIV-POST.  PROC                                                          
                                                                                
    PERFORM S03-RED-SKRIV-UTPOST                                                
    PUT TPFIL1                                                                  
                                                                                
 END-PROC                                                                       
NEWPAGE                                                                         
 S03-RED-SKRIV-UTPOST.  PROC                                                    
                                                                                
    TEMP1-FLOVRLAG    = '0'                                                     
    TEMP1-IDARTNR     = LB-IDARTNR                                              
    TEMP1-KDSRA       = LB-KDSRA                                                
    TEMP1-KVQPACK-0   = LB-KVQPACK-0                                            
    TEMP1-KDARTURS    = LB-KDARTURS                                             
    TEMP1-KDPRODSL    = LB-KDPRODSL                                             
    TEMP1-VLARTNTO    = LB-VLARTNTO                                             
    TEMP1-VKART       = LB-VKART                                                
    TEMP1-KDVSOP      = LB-KDVSOP                                               
    TEMP1-IDSTATNR    = LB-IDSTATNR(3)                                          
    TEMP1-KDSORT      = LB-KDSORT                                               
    TEMP1-KDERS       = LB-KDERS                                                
    TEMP1-KDERS-UTG   = LB-KDERS-UTG                                            
    TEMP1-KDBPSR      = LB-KDBPSR                                               
    TEMP1-KDUART      = LB-KDUART                                               
    TEMP1-KDBBCL      = W-KDBBCL                                                
    TEMP1-IDLEVNR     = LB-IDLEVNR                                              
    TEMP1-IDLEVNR-LOC = ' '                                                     
    TEMP1-KDAGE       = LB-KDAGE                                                
    TEMP1-IDPROJ      = LB-IDPROJ                                               
    TEMP1-IDFKNGRP    = LB-IDFKNGRP                                             
    TEMP1-PRARTSJK    = LB-PRARTSJK                                             
    TEMP1-PRARTSTD    = LB-PRARTSTD                                             
    TEMP1-BEART(1)    = LB-BEART(1)                                             
    TEMP1-BEART(2)    = LB-BEART(2)                                             
    TEMP1-BEART(3)    = LB-BEART(3)                                             
    TEMP1-BEART(4)    = LB-BEART(4)                                             
    TEMP1-BEART(5)    = LB-BEART(5)                                             
    TEMP1-BEART(6)    = LB-BEART(6)                                             
    TEMP1-BEART(7)    = LB-BEART(7)                                             
    TEMP1-BEART(8)    = LB-BEART(8)                                             
    TEMP1-BEART(9)    = LB-BEART(9)                                             
    TEMP1-BEART(10)   = LB-BEART(10)                                            
    TEMP1-KDPSLLOC    = LB-KDPSLLOC                                             
    TEMP1-TIFINLV     = LB-TIFINLV                                              
    TEMP1-KDSTANAUTG  = ' '                                                     
    TEMP1-FLSOFTWARE  = 'N'                                                     
    TEMP1-KDTIPPR     = LB-KDTIPPR                                              
    TEMP1-IDKAT(1)    = LB-IDKAT(1)                                             
    TEMP1-IDKAT(2)    = LB-IDKAT(2)                                             
    TEMP1-IDKAT(3)    = LB-IDKAT(3)                                             
    TEMP1-BELEVART    = ' '                                                     
    TEMP1-FLGEMFMC    = LB-FLGEMFMC                                             
    TEMP1-IDPROJUP    = LB-IDPROJUP                                             
    TEMP1-TIERSDAT    = LB-TIERSDAT                                             
    TEMP1-TIURPROD    = LB-TIURPROD                                             
 END-PROC                                                                       
*                                                                               
%WY2000P2                                                                       
*                                                                               
%WWPRODSL 'LB-' PROC ''                                                         
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*------------------------------------------------------------------*            
* STEG 3. MATCHAR TEMP1 & CROSSFIL TILL UTFIL                      *            
*------------------------------------------------------------------*            
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (TPFIL1 KEY(TEMP1-IDARTNR) W11614D5 KEY(CROSS-IDARTNR))               
                                                                                
    IF MATCHED                                                                  
        TEMP1-BELEVART = CROSS-BELEVART                                         
        PUT W11614D3 FROM TPFIL1                                                
    ELSE                                                                        
        IF TPFIL1                                                               
           PUT W11614D3 FROM TPFIL1                                             
        END-IF                                                                  
    END-IF                                                                      
*                                                                               
